"line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 439.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第六条 订单变化与退款\n\n行程变更导致取消、改期、提前离店或延住时，应保留原订单与变更记录，说明实际入住情况及退款金额。退款后不得按原订单全额报销；产生取消费时，应说明原因并请求确认，本文不规定取消费自动可报。\n\n个人旅游延住不能在申请中隐去，业务住宿与个人住宿应分别说明。同行人员分别付款或一人代付时，应保留参与关系及分摊说明，防止同一晚住宿重复申报。本文未", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 3.365854, "vector_score": 0.421302}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 186.0, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围\n\n员工在公司外访问内部系统时，需要使用企业VPN。企业VPN用于建立访问内部资源所需的网络连接；连接成功不代表自动获得每个系统的业务权限。用户仍需满足目标系统的账号、角色与授权要求。本文仅适用于企业员工的接入流程。\n\n本指南不规定个人设备准入、海外网络接入、承包商访问或其他远程访问产品的使用办法。若使用环境属于上述情况，应补充相", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 2.682565, "vector_score": 0.270977}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c008", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r008", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第八节 结束使用"], "token_count": 125, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 547.6171875, 134.25, 559.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 574.4765625, 541.5, 602.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第八节 结束使用\n\n完成远程工作后，应按客户端提供的方式断开连接，确认不再需要访问内部资源。不要把长期保持连接当成获得持续授权的证明。本文未规定自动断开时长或并发设备数量，这些限制需要查询具体服务配置。", "rrf_score": 0.015385, "bm25_score": 2.502931, "vector_score": 0.393687}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c012", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r012", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十二条 权限和故障"], "token_count": 129, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 157.25, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 654.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十二条 权限和故障\n\n系统无法上传附件或提交单据时，应记录发生时间、错误提示及申请单号，向内部服务渠道反馈。不要提供账号密码或验证码。技术故障本身不构成延期批准；本文没有规定故障期间的线下替代入口和期限豁免。", "rrf_score": 0.015152, "bm25_score": 2.453211, "vector_score": 0.387481}]}}
